Package: vbdanalysis
Title: Analysis pipeline for the VBD CDM
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Salvador", "Atagong", email = "you@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible R pipeline for analysis of the vector-borne
    disease Common Data Model. Reads directly from the CDM database
    written by the Python ingestion pipeline.
